---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Fractional Digital Strategy Lead for Nonprofits & GovCon"
  description="Senior-level digital strategy without a full-time hire. Fractional leadership for nonprofits and government contractors driving digital transformation."
>
  <style>
    .hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  align-items: center;
}
    .hero-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(50,52,90,0.12);
      display: block;
      background: #f3f4f6;
      min-height: 320px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      .hero-image-wrap {
        order: -1;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="service-hero container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Fractional Digital Strategy</span>
          <h1>Fractional Digital Strategy Lead</h1>
          <p class="service-intro">
            Most nonprofits and small GovCon subcontractors can't justify a full-time digital
            strategy hire — but still need someone senior steering the website, the content, the AI
            adoption, and the roadmap, instead of leaving it to whoever has time.
          </p>
          <p class="service-intro">
            Guiding Point Consulting acts as your <strong>fractional digital strategy lead</strong>,
            giving you senior-level direction on digital systems transformation on a retainer basis —
            without the overhead of a full-time salary.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-group" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Talk About Fractional Support</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image-wrap">
          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: swap src below with your chosen image -->
          <img
            src="/images/fractional-digital-strategy-lead-page.webp"
            alt="Fractional digital strategy illustration"
            class="hero-image"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What You Get -->
    <section class="service-section container">
      <h2>What You Get</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Ongoing strategic direction across your website, content operations, and AI adoption — one person accountable for how it all fits together</li>
        <li>Regular check-ins and a living roadmap, not a one-time deliverable that goes stale</li>
        <li>Hands-on execution when needed, not just advice from the sidelines</li>
        <li>A partner who understands both nonprofit operations and GovCon subcontractor requirements, so recommendations actually fit your world</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Who This Is For -->
    <section class="service-section container">
      <h2>Who This Is For</h2>
      <div class="audience-grid">
        <div class="audience-card">
          <p><strong>Nonprofits</strong> that need senior digital leadership but aren't ready for a full-time hire</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <p><strong>Government prime contractors</strong> who want a subcontractor partner providing ongoing fractional strategy across a digital modernization engagement, not just a single project</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <p>Organizations mid-transformation who need someone keeping the whole picture moving, not just one piece of it</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-this-box">
        <p><strong>What this is not:</strong> This isn't a one-off consulting call. It's ongoing, accountable partnership — someone who knows your systems well enough to keep pushing them forward month over month.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Outcome -->
    <section class="service-section container">
      <div class="outcome-box">
        <h2>The Outcome</h2>
        <p>A digital strategy that actually moves forward consistently, led by someone who understands both your mission and the practical realities of GovCon and nonprofit operations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="investment-box">
        <h3>Investment</h3>
        <p>Fractional retainers typically range from $4,500–$20,000/month depending on scope and involvement. We'll scope it with you before any commitment.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="service-cta container">
      <h2>Ready for Ongoing Strategic Support?</h2>
      <p>Let's talk about what fractional leadership could look like for your organization.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Talk About Fractional Support</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>